      Sparse internal-PHY words required by the validator.  ESP-IDF and the
      blob debug walker prove each containing block and address range, while
      the pinned ROM proves the concrete accesses.  Public ESP32-S31 PAC data
      does not name these words, so the identifiers deliberately retain
      OPAQUE instead of inventing hardware semantics, fields, or reset values.
    -->
