      <source id="MIGRATION_HE20_PEER">Git parent of migration-promotion commit f233006, migration/esp32s31-hybrid-runtime/src/he.rs; finite HE Capability/Operation parsing and peer-register transcription subsequently promoted into open driver crates.</source>
      <source id="MIGRATION_HE20_ASSOCIATION">Git parent of migration-promotion commit f233006, migration/esp32s31-hybrid-runtime/src/he.rs and association owner; finite interface-zero MMSS/AID transcription subsequently promoted into open driver crates.</source>
      <source id="MIGRATION_RX_AMPDU">Git parent of migration-promotion commit f233006, migration/esp32s31-hybrid-runtime/src/rx_ampdu_hw.rs blob 293a864aae77f5768054b3a0a8e7b5dbe78404e5; recovered RX BlockAck transaction later promoted to driver/esp32s31/wifi/lmac/src/rx_ampdu_hw.rs.</source>
      <source id="MIGRATION_TX_AMPDU">Git parent of migration-promotion commit f233006, migration/esp32s31-hybrid-runtime/src/tx_ampdu.rs blob 14b76600977613fa878d0e9838fabc4b63606bbd; recovered TX BlockAck transaction later promoted to driver/esp32s31/wifi/lmac/src/tx_ampdu.rs.</source>
      <source id="HIL_OPEN_AUTH_PTI_2026_07_29">../esp32s31_rust/firmware/esp32s31/app/src/open_radio_phy_prelude_hil.rs on ESP32-S31 rev0, open PHY/MAC and standard psram-code-psram-data profile, 2026-07-29. Five reset-to-connect runs read scheduler priority one and PTI image 0x00111110 for Authentication/Association.</source>
      <source id="HIL_VENDOR_CONNECTED_VECTOR_2026_07_29">../esp32s31_rust firmware wifi-sta-auth-probe on ESP32-S31 rev0 with the complete vendor driver, 2026-07-29. A synchronous connected HT queue snapshot read HT_DESCRIPTOR_COUNTS 0x00004081 and preserved the complete vector image before queue enable.</source>
      <source id="HIL_OPEN_HE_QUEUE_SCHEDULING_BASELINE_2026_07_29">../esp32s31_rust/firmware/esp32s31/app/src/open_radio_phy_prelude_hil.rs on ESP32-S31 rev0, open PHY/MAC, standard psram-code-psram-data profile and controlled HE20 AP, 2026-07-29. After HE association, WPA2 and TID0 AddBA, all ordinary-SU TB_ENA fields and Trigger/TB counters remained zero; MU-EDCA timers were disabled with REACHED=1.</source>
      <source id="HIL_OPEN_HE_RATE_CONTROL_ACK_SNR_2026_07_30">../esp32s31_rust/firmware/esp32s31/app/src/open_radio_phy_prelude_hil.rs on ESP32-S31 rev0, open PHY/MAC, standard psram-code-psram-data profile and FRITZ!Box 7530 FN HE20 channel 1, 2026-07-30. The owned Dot11Ax/1 schedule selected rate byte 0x19; the typed arena decoder published HE MCS9, two LTFs/1600 ns and peer-qualified LDPC at 108.3 Mbit/s. The first three-member A-MPDU received BlockAck bitmap 0x7 and its successful PRIMARY completion decoded ACK-SNR sample 70. DHCP completed in 7 ms; a following 100-packet ICMP run had zero loss and 4.244 ms average RTT.</source>
      <source id="S31_PMU_HEADERS">ESP-IDF master commit 102122904ade11fd1ae373848f34ffd7dfb18aeb, components/soc/esp32s31/register/soc/pmu_reg.h; local esp-wifi-sys commit 2585f278d381acc67c529fa730b91739b5461359, pmu_reg.h sha256 b1a04a306b9d7ee908e2f7b083d42b7a634f8687b6ee034cfe6f54f385e0d816 and pmu_struct.h sha256 5fc84c7569f9f24e193b0205728a647768c7c289b39d5ce679c50db7d8352e28</source>
      <source id="ESP_IDF_ESP32S31_MODEM_REG_BASE">Official ESP-IDF master commit 873d612fdeebf5dadc068670d320dbf4bcd742bc, components/soc/esp32s31/include/modem/reg_base.h, sha256 86a9909938d4db06b3d11c4c386a2c3dbdcd9657b6d194a216202b796ada13b9. It defines MODEM_BASE 0x20100000, MODEM_PWR_BASE 0x2010d000 and the FE, WIFI_MAC, WIFI_BB, WIFI_BB_BRX, MODEM_TIMER, MODEM_ETM, MODEM_DATADUMP, MODEM_WIDGETS, MODEM_SYSCON, MODEM_LPCON, I2C_ANA_MST and I2C_ANA_MST_MEM sub-block bases.</source>
